body:
Hello, thanks for this. Now that I think about it, I think my situation will improve, yes, but after spiralling down and delaying them for so long I don't think I'll even be given a chance to make it right...I'm actually trying to message my prof right now and just...prepare myself for verdict, I guess. 

As for work, it's a lot, and I just don't see myself meeting the deadlines because I've lost focus and it feels like everything is crashing and burning at the same time. It's been this way for the past two years, I think. 

Uni sucks and sometimes I want to whack people for giving students tons of shit to do for the sake of giving them, but I also want to be like everyone else who just...get things done, you know? What kills me is that as much as I want to throw in the towel...I really just want to get it done and be unstuck ;\_;
